	(descr "TO-220-5 Vertical, hand-authored laser variant of TO-220-3_Vertical_LaserPads extended to 5 pads. Lead pitch widened to 2.54mm (0.1in) so the 1.7mm-wide pads leave a 0.84mm gap >= 0.8mm laser clearance (the stock 1.7mm-pitch Pentawatt footprint cannot). Pads numbered 1-5 = LM2576T-5 pins Vin/Out/GND/FB/ON-OFF. Form the LM2576 leads to a single 2.54mm-pitch inline row.")
